(6463569, 960700, 104198, '<td valign="top">I Really love the shape and colors of the fireworks. I wonder if adjusting the shadows could have darkened the background and hidden the smoke clouds.<br/>Also, I think I would have prefered to have the cityscape cropped out to give total attention to firework.  A well done photo though, even as is.</td>', 'I Really love the shape and colors of the fireworks. I wonder if adjusting the shadows could have darkened the background and hidden the smoke clouds.Also, I think I would have prefered to have the cityscape cropped out to give total attention to firework.  A well done photo though, even as is.', '2011-07-06 20:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6463586, 960496, 104198, '<td valign="top">Nice out of the box thinking and highly original, however the drab sepia tone and the fact that I had to actually THINK (gasp!) about it, does not overcome my expectation to see pretty shiny explosions... I can''t really mark it "Down" because it is Technically fine, and well within the challenge topic, but it has no "WOW" aspect to it either, so I will leave it at five.  Please continue with out of the box style entries though, I usually like them!</td>', 'Nice out of the box thinking and highly original, however the drab sepia tone and the fact that I had to actually THINK (gasp!) about it, does not overcome my expectation to see pretty shiny explosions... I can''t really mark it "Down" because it is Technically fine, and well within the challenge topic, but it has no "WOW" aspect to it either, so I will leave it at five.  Please continue with out of the box style entries though, I usually like them!', '2011-07-06 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
