(6468997, 960383, 88235, '<td valign="top">I still think this should have scored better... At least it was in the top 10.<br/>If you don''t mind some advice. The patch tool may have helped with your silhouette issues. It takes a little bit of work to create clean lines around the people, but is well worth it. I had to use it to clean up the guy in my pic. He had moved about 2/3 of the way through the exposure.<br/> <br/>Hey, I just noticed... Congrats on your highest ranked picture!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-13 02:11:45.</i></td>', 'I still think this should have scored better... At least it was in the top 10.If you don''t mind some advice. The patch tool may have helped with your silhouette issues. It takes a little bit of work to create clean lines around the people, but is well worth it. I had to use it to clean up the guy in my pic. He had moved about 2/3 of the way through the exposure. Hey, I just noticed... Congrats on your highest ranked picture!', '2011-07-13 03:09:31.000000', '2011-07-13 03:11:45.000000', 0),
